Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 20:48:13 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1123/1198] The guide in the page's language; the rich tips in
 Russian (1166, part two)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

heresy-guide.js reads docs/GUIDE.<lang>.md when the page is in that language and the file is there, else the English
GUIDE.md; a translated heading ends in <!-- #id --> (or {#id}), the English heading's own id, so HeresyGuide.open(tab,
stop) finds the same place in every language (checked: the Trainer's link to «Rank and the other knobs» lands on «Ранг и
другие ручки»). The guide's words are its own: the page's translator leaves its title, tabs, stops and body; another
language reads the guide again and shows it on the same tab.

Russian: the rich tips of <template> (LoRA, VAE, sliders, the two seeds, output, context, the transcriber, the
instrumental), the states before the server answers, and the controls the guide names (69 more; 2,417 keys in all).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
